# This portfolio is a static Next.js site with no backend, auth, or database.
# No secrets are required for local development or Vercel production deploys.
#
# If you later add server-side features (contact form API, analytics, CMS):
# - Put secrets here as plain KEY= placeholders (never real values)
# - Never prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_ (that exposes them to the browser)
# - Set real values in Vercel Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# Example placeholders (unused today):
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
# RATE_LIMIT_SECRET=
